<hr></hr>

<p align="center"><a href="https://ibb.co/kmMR9Qb"><img src="https://i.ibb.co/SfJhdRY/brute-balance.png" alt="brute-balance" width="1000" border="0"></a>
<br/>

<p align="center">
<h2>Brute Weapons Features:</h2>

``` 
* Weapons have roughly 20% higher base damage over vanilla two-handed weapons

* Weapons have roughly 20% higher base durability over vanilla two-handed weapons

* Brute Weapons now have a 3-swing primary attack combo like their one handed counterparts

* Brute Weapons now have a powerful, high damage secondary attack

* FULL customization available for crafting costs, upgrade costs, crafting station, etc!
```
<br>
<p align="center"><h2>Brute Weapons drawbacks:</h2>

``` 
* Weapons have roughly 20% more stamina costs compared to vanilla two-handed weapons

* Weapons have slightly higher speed reductions compared to vanilla two-handed weapons
```
