<p align="center"><h3>Dependencies:</h3>

>*  BepInEx

<p align="center"><h3>Instructions:</h3>
<li>Download the latest copy of <b>BepInEx</b> per the author's instructions.  </li>
<li>Extract <b>BruteWeapons.zip</b> into the "\BepInEx\plugins\" folder.</li>



</ul>
